      "text": [
        " كَانَ رَشُّ الْقَبْرِ عَلَى عَهْدِ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Talha Bin Zayd, ",
          "from Abyu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Sprinkling the grave (with water) was prevalent upon the era of Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "7. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from Muhammad ibn Sinan from Talhah ibn Zayd who has said the following: “Abu ’Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that sprinkling water over a new grave was during the time of the Messenger of Allah.” "
        ]
      }
    },
